    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Kyra Vinet",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112982422145535963024/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjULIPCwyiEMscLyYkYxOaALpDApzGDzXkCY2KTRwDFXIxXHSO60=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "Came here with my friends and turned out to be a great choice. Many pizzas to choose from with fun toppings for adventurous eaters. We ate inside, there was very nice ambient lighting. Very clean and cozy place. Service was amazing, prices were reasonable and portion size was perfect.",
        "time": 1751203952,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jessica Longo",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101413320407627050555/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKt_7igoI4-gdywAlI0_ILkguMhmOKXg2017h3c4MykIb_Xow=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Amazing ! Loved the fresh ingredients on the Pizza L’antica. The dough is thin and perfectly cooked, sauce is light and not salty at all! Cheese was fresh and light too. The service was amazing as well ! It’s my 3rd time coming to this restaurant and I drive from Cornwall just to eat their pizza. By far better than pizza I ate in Ottawa. I highly recommend pizzeria 900 in vaudreuil to anyone looking for a top quality Neapolitan pizza.  Thank you for the great food and service",
        "time": 1768146143,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Casey Sidhu",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116405565427788502287/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWffYc6WX9ys8cK8kYyeuSEGlGr3T3oFOwynis6oIRk0tIAHP3PDg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "The restaurant's design is nice and very modern. The service was good but felt a little inattentive, just some unnecessary pauses after ordering drinks when we could have ordered the pizza simultaneously, however, that might have been a fault of our communication. The pizza's ingredients were of high quality, and they did a decent justice to them. My one suggestion is perhaps a lower oven temp. I've seen some other reviews showing a slightly burnt crust. Our pizza was a little underdone in the middle. Overall, for the price, I enjoyed it and will be back 100%.",
        "time": 1723767936,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Mimi the Travel Bee",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117542156103217041817/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJufuwpf_TeMGCkA-nEYnaOLVii1vwkfQAGJxD8Nj6h7VDhyw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Perfect date night spot! Great service, tasty thin-crust pizza, and a cozy patio. Highly recommend.",
        "time": 1760888826,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Samantha Vince",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105149985701971929336/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKR4qomP2VrhYVDNPCD4swvGFPSJsrxPp1PR2ab_NO8PgeH=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "We love this place. Not only is the food amazing, but the staff and owners are so friendly and welcoming! Tonight we decided to make supper at home because I have so much food with holiday prep.. so I picked up their fresh dough and made at home. OMG!! the dough is a dream to work with! Must try for a fun in home dinner night! Also the front of house staff couldn’t be nicer! Spoke to a great guy about Christmas shopping even though he had just finished exams. Whoever you are - koodos- you made my day! - Samantha Vince",
        "time": 1766452357,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
